  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan uses it when righteous factions have him surrounded at the end of his first life, and that use returns him to Qing Mao Mountain five hundred years earlier.",
        "chapters": [
          1
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_fang_yuan",
          "loc_qing_mao_mountain"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "After that rebirth he is fifteen years old.",
        "chapters": [
          9
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Even at rank six, Fang Yuan needed only to squeeze it lightly to squish it.",
        "chapters": [
          582
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "fragile-body",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "He could destroy it by squeezing it between his fingers lightly.",
        "chapters": [
          788
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "fragile-body",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Being only rank six, the Gu carries a lasting flaw: every activation risks failure. Counting the activation that ended his previous five-hundred-year life, it had already succeeded three times, at Qing Mao Mountain and then at San Cha Mountain in this life, and the fourth use, forced by the rank nine Immortal Gu House Heaven Overseeing Tower’s attack, is the one that finally fails. A ghost face rises from the river and spits out a red lotus whose light restores his dissipating will and the shattered Gu together, sending him backward only a little over a year, far short of the several hundred years Fang Yuan reckons his foundation and his Immortal Gu should have bought him.",
        "chapters": [
          970
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "first-failure-and-the-ghost-faces-restoration",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "loc_san_cha_mountain",
          "house_heaven_overseeing_tower"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "During the Yi Tian Mountain battle, Ying Wu Xie taunts Fang Yuan that Old Man Yan Shi has already deduced Spring Autumn Cicada cannot be used in its current state.",
        "chapters": [
          1011
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "deduced-unusable",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "loc_yi_tian_mountain",
          "char_old_man_yan_shi"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Spectral Soul Demon Venerable’s will tells Ying Wu Xie that heaven’s will arranged Fang Yuan’s obtaining of Spring Autumn Cicada from the start, had already infused the Gu with itself, and that the Gu lowers his luck.",
        "chapters": [
          1022
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "heavens-will-inside",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_spectral_soul_demon_venerable"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Ying Wu Xie, still an immortal zombie and still holding the Gu, reckons that its load of heaven’s will makes him a torch in the darkness from heaven’s will’s perspective.",
        "chapters": [
          1044
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "heavens-will-inside",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Later, with heaven’s will no longer helping Fang Yuan in secret but wanting to eradicate him, the heaven’s will inside Spring Autumn Cicada would directly kill him if he activated it.",
        "chapters": [
          1362
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "heavens-will-inside",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Spring Autumn Cicada comes back sealed by Heavenly Court’s Gu Immortals with strange methods, already cut off from the River of Time and in a starving state, and Fang Yuan knows it still holds heaven’s will.",
        "chapters": [
          1079
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "sealed-by-heavenly-court",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "sys_gu_immortal"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Unable to absorb the water of the River of Time, it can only bear its hunger passively and falls gradually toward the abyss of destruction.",
        "chapters": [
          1085
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "sealed-by-heavenly-court",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Because it remains the vital Gu of his first aperture, it returns to Fang Yuan together with his body once he regains both from Shadow Sect.",
        "chapters": [
          1079
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "sealed-by-heavenly-court",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "fac_shadow_sect"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Still firmly sealed inside Fang Yuan’s rank five peak stage aperture, his own original aperture, its purple crystal walls are already cracked under the pressure of housing a rank six Immortal Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          1446
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "still-sealed-at-rank-five",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      }
    ]
  },
